* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* RCONV--N
* Version      3.4
* Function     Call ghostscript on Unix machines for conversion
*
*              - Expects XXUX---P to be filled by caller
*              - Can process text-, postscript-, and PDF-files
*              - Converts into any format ghostscript knows
*              - Converts into RTF and HTML (by enscript) but from
*                text files only
*
* Maintenance
* uuu     yyyy-mm-dd iTrac       Action
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
* fhi     2012-05-30 NOMALL-1004 created
* SU1     2013-01-31 unused      Deactivate unused data areas
* fhi     2013-04-17 NOMALL-1004 corrections, no tags
* fhi     2013-11-05 NOMALL-1295 Correct append flag, correct 'MOVE'
* fhi     2013-12-04 NOMALL-1004 Change to asynchronous COMMAND call
* fhi     2013-12-09 NOMALL-1004 Avoid parallel delete by waiting
* fhi     2014-01-13 NOMALL-1004 same
* fhi     2014-02-20 NOMALL-1338 Use long command fields
* fhi     2014-02-28 NOMALL-1337 Avoid /dev/null, no more allowed in NPR
* fhi     2014-03-03 NOMALL-1363 Avoid loop in check log file
* fhi     2014-03-04 NOMALL-1363 same
* fhi     2014-03-06 NOMALL-1363 same
* fhi     2014-03-10 NOMALL-1363 Avoid deletion of find's logfile
* fhi     2014-06-26 NOMALL-1322 Add concatenation by 'cat'
* fhi     2014-06-28 NOMALL-1322 same
* fhi     2014-06-30 NOMALL-1485 Do everything also for bundles
* fhi     2014-07-02 NOMALL-1322 Still conversion errors in QA.
* fhi     2014-07-03 NOMALL-1234 buffer corrupted.
* fhi     2014-07-15 NOMALL-1430 Add trace
* fhi     2014-07-16 NOMALL-1430 Correct log file reading
* fhi     2014-08-21 NOMALL-1475 Introduce uniprint for UTF-8;
*                                Correct check of module existance
*                                Some parts rewritten without tags.
* fhi     2014-08-29 NOMALL-1454 Recataloged due to changes of XXUX---P
* fhi     2014-09-03 NOMALL-1454 Adapt to NPR 2.1.5.1, no tags.
* fhi     2014-09-19 NOMALL-1454 Correct NOM1595 message
* fhi     2014-09-26 NOMALL-1475 Correct logfile handling, more trace.
* fhi     2014-09-29 NOMALL-1475 Correct pipe character, exit codes
* fhi     2014-09-30 NOMALL-1475 Correct exit codes
* fhi     2014-10-08 NOMALL-1504 Translate filetype into lower,not upper
*                                No tags for that.
* fhi     2014-10-09 NOMALL-1504 Translate filetype into
*                                lower only if generated by NOM. No tags
* SU2     2014-12-19 NOMALL-1548 remove unused LDA
* fhi     2015-05-28 NOMALL-1585 Check file-ids and correct them
* fhi     2015-06-16 NOMALL-1585 Make Env vars unique
* fhi     2015-06-19 NOMALL-1585 Make MOVEs    unique
* fhi     2015-06-22 NOMALL-1585 same
* SU3     2015-07-30 NOMALL-1680 avoid error:file:invalid option -- '-q'
* fhi     2015-08-12 NOMALL-1663 Avoid NPR's 'output file not found'
* fhi     2015-08-14 NOMALL-1696 Improve locked files detection on Unix
* fhi     2015-08-20 NOMALL-1663 Avoid empty target file for MOVE
* fhi     2015-09-09 NOMALL-1663 Sporadic error with output file not fd.
* fhi     2015-09-17 NOMALL-1663 Correct exit code handling
* fhi     2015-09-23 NOMALL-1663 same
* fhi     2015-10-15 NOMALL-1747 Improve error handling of 1127 and 2142
* fhi     2015-11-03 NOMALL-1747 Avoid object not found error
* fhi     2015-11-03 NOMALL-1767 Sporadic NOM2147, provide more trace
*                                Avoid deletion of logfile before 'file'
*                                Avoid general delete mit 'find -delete'
* fhi     2016-03-14 NOMALL-1696 Don't use default UTILPATH
* fhi     2016-03-23 NOMALL-1696 same
* fhi     2016-04-05 NOMALL-1696 Improve locked files detection on Unix
* fhi     2016-07-21 NOMALL-1901 Improve error msg for missing modules
* fhi     2016-08-01 NOMALL-1903 Use XXCHCKUX for checking if modules
*                                are executable.Partly rewritten.No tags
* fhi     2016-08-11 NOMALL-1903 Return #FILE-LOCKED from XXLOCKED
* fhi     2017-01-05 NOMALL-1961 Improve err handling (return to ERROR)
* fhi     2017-02-03 NOMALL-1913 Use new SAT routine SATTIMST
* fhi     2017-02-06 NOMALL-1993 file command fails on AIX (Bela)
* fhi     2017-02-20 NOMALL-1993 test -x command fails on AIX
* bli     2018-07-20 NOMALL-2088 error handling
* bli     2019-05-03 NOMALL-2261 NPR 2.1.12 buffer, lda, pda
* SU4     2023-06-13 ES-33831    removed comments (itrac for uqac only)
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*
DEFINE DATA
*
PARAMETER USING RCONV--P
PARAMETER USING XXUX---P
/* Parameter description:
* CONV-FILENAME               (A250) /* Output file to be generated
*                                       If empty: take CONV-INFILES
*                                       without '*' (IN/OUT)
* CONV-FILETYPE               (A250) /* type of output file (OUT)
* CONV-PATH                   (A250) /* directory to operate on (IN)
* CONV-LOGPATH                (A250) /* directory for log files (IN)
* CONV-INFILES                (A250) /* input file(s) (optional '*')(IN)
* CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT          (A16)  /* (IN) desired file format:
*                                       'PS','EPS','PDF','PCL',
*                                       'TIFF','JPEG','PNG','BMP',
*                                       'RTF','HTML'
* CONV-FORMATTER              (A50)  /* (IN) The program that renders
* CONV-HEADER                 (A50)  /* (IN) enscript --fancy-header
* CONV-HEADER-FONT            (A50)  /* (IN) enscript --header-font
* CONV-FOOTER                 (A50)  /* (IN) enscript --footer
* CONV-FONT                   (A50)  /* (IN) enscript --font
* CONV-LINES                  (A3)   /* (IN) enscript --lines-per-page
* CONV-LANDSCAPE              (A1)   /* (IN) enscript -r / -R
* CONV-MEDIA                  (A50)  /* (IN) enscript -M
* CONV-CODEPAGE               (A50)  /* (IN) enscript --encoding
* CONV-ADDITIONAL             (A50)  /* (IN) user parameters
* CONV-TRACING                (L)    /* (IN)
* CONV-ERC                    (N4)   /* (OUT)
* CONV-ERT                    (A250) /* (OUT)
* All CONV- parameters are optional besides INFILES and OUTPUT-FORMAT
* --------------------------------------- Independent ------------------
INDEPENDENT
1 +HEX-TIMESTAMP              (A20)
1 +CONV-FILEID                (A250)
1 +T-UTILITY                  (A/7) DYNAMIC
* --------------------------------------- Local Data -------------------
LOCAL
1 #NPR-TRACE-INT              (I2)
1 #TRACE-MSG                  (A250)
1 #UX-FUNCTION                (A8)
1 #P-OPSYS                    (A8)
1 #I                          (I4)
1 #REP                        (I4)
1 #REP-WAIT                   (I4)
1 #WARNING                    (L)
1 #LEN                        (I4)
1 #POS                        (I4)
1 #LOGFILE-ID                 (A250)
1 #COMMAND                    (A1000) /* NOMALL-2261 was (A500)
1 #FILES-COMMAND              (A1000) /* NOMALL-2261 was (A500)
1 #FILE                       (A250)
1 #FILE2                      (A250)
1 #FILE2TYPE                  (A10)
1 #FILETYPE                   (A10)
1 #FILES                      (A250)
1 #FILES-REMAINING            (A)  DYNAMIC
1 #FILP                       (A250)
1 #CONV-ERC                   (N4)
1 #CONV-ERT                   (A250)
1 #STACK-FUNCTION             (A10)
1 #STACK-RC                   (N1)
1 #DEVICE                     (A16)
1 #RECORD                     (A250)
1 #OUTFILE                    (A250)
1 #TMPFILE                    (A250)
1 #TIMESTAMP                  (A20)
1 #HEX                        (A1)   CONST <'H'>
1 #ENSCRIPT-PARMS             (A250)
1 #UNIPRINT-PARMS             (A250)
1 #P-ERC                      (N4)
1 #ZEROBYTE                   (A2)
1 #UTILPATH                   (A250)
1 #GSMOD                      (A250)
1 #ENMOD                      (A250)
1 #UNMOD                      (A250)
1 #PDFTK                      (A)    DYNAMIC
1 #FIND                       (A)    DYNAMIC
1 #FILE-CMD                   (A)    DYNAMIC
1 #INDEVICE                   (A16/11) INIT
  <'PS','EPS','PDF','PCL','TIFF','JPEG','PNG','BMP','RTF','HTML','FAX'>
1 #OUTDEVICE                  (A16/11) INIT
  <'ps2write','epswrite','pdfwrite','pxlcolor','tiff32nc',
  'jpeg','png16m','bmp16m','rtf','html','tiffg3'>
1 #TYPE                       (A16/11) INIT
  <'ps','eps','pdf','prn','tif','jpg','png','bmp','rtf','htm','tif'>
1 #SECOND                     (I2)   INIT <1>
1 #P-PROCESS-ID               (N10)
1 #GETATTR                    (A197) /* File Attributes
1 REDEFINE #GETATTR
  2 #REST                     (A5)
  2 #OWNER                    (A8)
  2 #SIZE                     (N10) /* Bytes
  2 #MOD-DATE-TIME            (N14) /* yyyymmddhhmmss
  2 #GETATTR-FILLER           (A158)
  2 #FILE-LOCKED              (A1)
* 1 #SIZE-OLD                 (N10) /* Bytes, NOMALL-1696 out
1 #CATDATE                    (A19)
1 #TEXTFILES                  (L)
/* Use trigraph notation of NPR:
1 #PIPE                       (A3) CONST < '??_'> /*SU3 (A1)->(A3)+CONST
1 #P-BINARY                   (A1)
1 #EXIT-CODE                  (N4)
1 #EXIT-MESSAGE               (A50)
  INIT <';echo&+&NPR3355&+&Exit&+&code&+&$?'>
1 #FONT                       (A50)
1 #DEFAULT-FONT               (A50) INIT <'DejaVuSansMono.ttf'>
1 #FSIZE                      (A50)
1 #RC                         (N4)
1 #CONV-FILEID                (A250)
1 #GETENV-ERC                 (N4)
1 #GETENV-ERT                 (A250)
1 #P-ERT                      (A250)
*
END-DEFINE
*
************************************************************************
* Main line
************************************************************************
*
FORMAT (0) PS=0 LS=250
*
IF CONV-TRACING
  PERFORM XXCATAL-GET-CATDATE #CATDATE
  COMPRESS *PROGRAM 'cataloged at'  #CATDATE TO #TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  #NPR-TRACE-INT := *LEVEL + 1
  COMPRESS 'Starting conversion' '- for file:' CONV-FILENAME
    '- with type:' CONV-FILETYPE '- output as:' CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT
    TO #TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  END TRANSACTION
END-IF
*
#TIMESTAMP := +HEX-TIMESTAMP
IF #TIMESTAMP = ' '
  PERFORM SATTIMST-GET-TIME #HEX #TIMESTAMP
END-IF
* Check if basic functions available
* ----------------------------------
IF CONV-LOGPATH = ' '
  CONV-LOGPATH := CONV-PATH
END-IF
RESET CONV-ERC
DECIDE ON EVERY VALUE OF CONV-ERC
*
  VALUE 0
    CALLNAT 'XXCHCKUX' XXUX---P CONV-LOGPATH
    CONV-ERC   := P-ERC
    CONV-ERT   := P-ERT
    #GSMOD     := +T-UTILITY(2)
    #ENMOD     := +T-UTILITY(3)
    #UNMOD     := +T-UTILITY(4)
    #FIND      := +T-UTILITY(5)
    #FILE-CMD  := +T-UTILITY(6)
    #PDFTK     := +T-UTILITY(7)
    DECIDE FOR EVERY CONDITION
      WHEN #FIND = 'NONE'
        CONV-ERC := 2142
        COMPRESS '2142 find' P-NODE-NAME TO CONV-ERT
      WHEN #FILE-CMD = 'NONE'
        CONV-ERC := 2142
        COMPRESS '2142 file' P-NODE-NAME TO CONV-ERT
      WHEN NONE
        IGNORE
    END-DECIDE
*
  VALUE 0
    #FILP        := CONV-PATH
    EXAMINE DIRECTION BACKWARD #FILP FOR '/' GIVING POSITION #POS
      LENGTH #LEN
    IF #POS = #LEN AND #LEN > 1
      #POS := #POS - 1
      #FILP := SUBSTR(#FILP,1,#POS)
    END-IF
    PERFORM XXGETENV-GET-VARS #FILP P-ERC P-ERT XXUX---P
    IF P-ERC = 0
      COMPRESS 'P' *PID INTO P-FILE-NAME LEAVING NO
      PERFORM XXCHKFN-CHECK-FILENAME #FILP #RC
      P-RECORD     := #FILP
      IF CONV-TRACING
        COMPRESS 'Path Environment Variable' P-FILE-NAME '=' #FILP
          TO #TRACE-MSG
        PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
      END-IF
      #UX-FUNCTION := 'PUTENV'
      PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
      COMPRESS '$P' *PID INTO CONV-PATH LEAVING NO
    ELSE
      RESET CONV-ERC CONV-ERT P-ERC P-ERT /* use original path
    END-IF
* Check and evaluate parameters
* -----------------------------
  VALUE 0 /*  Prepare fields
    RESET CONV-ERT
    COMPRESS ";" H'00' TO #ZEROBYTE LEAVING NO
    REPEAT
      EXAMINE CONV-INFILES FOR ' *' REPLACE '*'
      EXAMINE CONV-INFILES FOR ' *' GIVING POSITION IN #I
      UNTIL #I = 0
    END-REPEAT
    RESET #FILES-COMMAND /* Check files only, no command
    COMPRESS CONV-PATH '/' CONV-INFILES TO #FILES LEAVING NO
    EXAMINE #FILES FOR '//' REPLACE '/'
    PERFORM PROCESS-FILES
* *****
  VALUE 0
    IF CONV-FILENAME = ' '
      CONV-FILENAME := CONV-INFILES
      EXAMINE CONV-FILENAME FOR '*' AND DELETE
    END-IF
    COMPRESS CONV-LOGPATH '/.' CONV-FILENAME '-chck-' *PID '-'
      #TIMESTAMP '.log' TO #LOGFILE-ID LEAVING NO
    PERFORM XXCHKFN-CHECK-FILENAME #LOGFILE-ID #RC
    COMPRESS 'file&+&' CONV-PATH '/' CONV-INFILES #PIPE
     'grep&+&-q&+&-v&+&''&+&text''' #EXIT-MESSAGE TO #COMMAND LEAVING NO
    RESET P-OUTPUT-MODE
    P-WAIT-TERM := 'Y'
    PERFORM EXEC-UNIX-COMMAND
* *****
  VALUE 0
    P-FILE-NAME    := #LOGFILE-ID
    RESET P-EXIT-CODE
    #UX-FUNCTION   := 'GETEXIT'
    PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
    IF P-EXIT-CODE = 1
      #TEXTFILES := TRUE
    ELSE
      #TEXTFILES := FALSE
    END-IF
  VALUE 0
    RESET CONV-ERC CONV-ERT #LOGFILE-ID
    #UX-FUNCTION   := 'DELETE'
    PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
    RESET CONV-ERC CONV-ERT #LOGFILE-ID
    IF CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT = ' ' AND NOT #TEXTFILES
      #FILETYPE := CONV-FILETYPE
      CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT := #FILETYPE
    END-IF
    EXAMINE CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT TRANSLATE INTO UPPER
    EXAMINE #INDEVICE (*) FOR CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT GIVING INDEX #I
    IF #I > 0
      #DEVICE       := #OUTDEVICE (#I)
      CONV-FILETYPE := #TYPE (#I)
      COMPRESS CONV-PATH '/' CONV-FILENAME '.' CONV-FILETYPE
        TO #OUTFILE LEAVING NO
      COMPRESS CONV-PATH '/' CONV-FILENAME '-' *PID '.' CONV-FILETYPE
        TO #TMPFILE LEAVING NO
    ELSE
      #DEVICE       := CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT
      COMPRESS CONV-PATH '/' CONV-FILENAME TO #OUTFILE LEAVING NO
      IF CONV-FILETYPE NE ' '
        COMPRESS #OUTFILE '.' CONV-FILETYPE TO #OUTFILE LEAVING NO
      END-IF
      COMPRESS CONV-PATH '/' CONV-FILENAME '-' *PID TO #TMPFILE
      IF CONV-FILETYPE NE ' '
        COMPRESS #TMPFILE '.' CONV-FILETYPE TO #TMPFILE LEAVING NO
      END-IF
      IF NOT #TEXTFILES AND #DEVICE = #FILETYPE
/* user-defined filetype without gs device
        CONV-ERC := 2147
        COMPRESS '2147' #DEVICE TO CONV-ERT
      END-IF
    END-IF
* *****
  VALUE 0
    PERFORM XXCHKFN-CHECK-FILENAME #OUTFILE #RC
    PERFORM XXCHKFN-CHECK-FILENAME #TMPFILE #RC
*   Get parameters for enscript / uniprint
    IF #ENMOD NE 'NONE'
      RESET #ENSCRIPT-PARMS
      DECIDE FOR EVERY CONDITION    /* &+& represents a ' '
        WHEN CONV-HEADER = ' '
          COMPRESS #ENSCRIPT-PARMS '&+&-B' TO #ENSCRIPT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-HEADER NE ' '
          IF CONV-HEADER NE 'default'
            COMPRESS #ENSCRIPT-PARMS '&+&--fancy-header="' CONV-HEADER '"'
              TO #ENSCRIPT-PARMS LEAVING NO
          ELSE
            COMPRESS #ENSCRIPT-PARMS '&+&--fancy-header'
              TO #ENSCRIPT-PARMS LEAVING NO
          END-IF
        WHEN CONV-HEADER-FONT NE ' '
          COMPRESS #ENSCRIPT-PARMS '&+&--header-font="' CONV-HEADER-FONT '"'
            TO #ENSCRIPT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-FOOTER NE ' '
          EXAMINE CONV-FOOTER FOR '$' REPLACE WITH '+$+'
          EXAMINE CONV-FOOTER FOR '%' REPLACE WITH '+%+'
/* Lines above: Mask '$' and '%' with NPR notation to avoid replacement
/* of environment variables in '--footer' parameter
          COMPRESS #ENSCRIPT-PARMS '&+&--footer="' CONV-FOOTER '"'
            TO #ENSCRIPT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-FONT NE ' '
          COMPRESS #ENSCRIPT-PARMS '&+&--font="' CONV-FONT '"'
            TO #ENSCRIPT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-LINES NE ' ' AND CONV-LINES NE '0'
          COMPRESS #ENSCRIPT-PARMS '&+&--lines-per-page="' CONV-LINES '"'
            TO #ENSCRIPT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-LANDSCAPE NE ' '
          COMPRESS #ENSCRIPT-PARMS '&+&-r'
            TO #ENSCRIPT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-MEDIA NE ' '
          COMPRESS #ENSCRIPT-PARMS '&+&-M&+&"' CONV-MEDIA '"'
            TO #ENSCRIPT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-CODEPAGE NE ' '
          COMPRESS #ENSCRIPT-PARMS '&+&--encoding="' CONV-CODEPAGE '"'
            TO #ENSCRIPT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-ADDITIONAL NE ' '
          COMPRESS #ENSCRIPT-PARMS  '&+&"' CONV-ADDITIONAL '"'
            TO #ENSCRIPT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN NONE
          IGNORE
      END-DECIDE
    END-IF
    IF #UNMOD NE 'NONE'
      RESET #UNIPRINT-PARMS
      DECIDE FOR EVERY CONDITION    /* &+& represents a ' '
        WHEN CONV-HEADER-FONT NE ' '
          COMPRESS #UNIPRINT-PARMS '&+&-hsize&+&"'
            CONV-HEADER-FONT '"' TO #UNIPRINT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-HEADER-FONT = ' '
          COMPRESS #UNIPRINT-PARMS '&+&-hsize&+&0'
            TO #UNIPRINT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-FONT NE ' '
          SEPARATE CONV-FONT INTO #FONT #FSIZE WITH DELIMITER ' ' IGNORE
          IF #FONT IS (N4)
            #FSIZE := #FONT
            #FONT  := #DEFAULT-FONT
          END-IF
          COMPRESS #UNIPRINT-PARMS '&+&-font&+&"' #FONT '"'
            TO #UNIPRINT-PARMS LEAVING NO
          IF #FSIZE NE ' '
            COMPRESS #UNIPRINT-PARMS '&+&-size&+&"'
              #FSIZE '"' TO #UNIPRINT-PARMS LEAVING NO
          END-IF
        WHEN CONV-FONT = ' '
          COMPRESS #UNIPRINT-PARMS '&+&-font&+&' #DEFAULT-FONT
            '&+&-size&+&8' TO #UNIPRINT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-LANDSCAPE NE ' '
          COMPRESS #UNIPRINT-PARMS '&+&-L' TO #UNIPRINT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-MEDIA NE ' '
          COMPRESS #UNIPRINT-PARMS '&+&-media&+&"' CONV-MEDIA '"'
            TO #UNIPRINT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-CODEPAGE NE ' '
          COMPRESS #UNIPRINT-PARMS '&+&-decode&+&"' CONV-CODEPAGE '"'
            TO #UNIPRINT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-ADDITIONAL NE ' '
          COMPRESS #UNIPRINT-PARMS  '&+&"' CONV-ADDITIONAL '"'
            TO #UNIPRINT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        WHEN NONE
          IGNORE
      END-DECIDE
    END-IF
* Do the conversion
* -----------------
    IF CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT = 'RTF' OR = 'HTML'
*     Call enscript to convert text to rtf or html into one file
      IF #ENMOD = 'NONE'
        CONV-ERC := 2142
        COMPRESS '2142 enscript' P-NODE-NAME TO CONV-ERT
      ELSE
        COMPRESS #ENSCRIPT-PARMS '&+&--language=' #DEVICE
          TO #ENSCRIPT-PARMS LEAVING NO
        COMPRESS #ENMOD '&+&-qZho&+&' #TMPFILE '&+&' #ENSCRIPT-PARMS
          '&+&' CONV-PATH '/' CONV-INFILES TO #COMMAND LEAVING NO
        #LOGFILE-ID   := 'default'
        P-WAIT-TERM   := 'N'
        P-OUTPUT-MODE := 'A' /* Append logfile
        PERFORM EXEC-UNIX-COMMAND
      END-IF
    END-IF
* *****
  VALUE 0
    IF CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT NE 'RTF' AND CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT NE 'HTML'
*     Convert all text files to ps
      IF NOT #TEXTFILES OR CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT NE ' '
        COMPRESS CONV-PATH '/' CONV-INFILES TO #FILES LEAVING NO
        EXAMINE #FILES FOR '//' REPLACE '/'
        DECIDE FOR EVERY CONDITION
          WHEN CONV-FORMATTER = 'auto' AND #UNMOD = 'NONE'
            CONV-FORMATTER := 'enscript' /* Use uniprint if available
          WHEN CONV-FORMATTER = 'auto' AND #UNMOD NE 'NONE'
            CONV-FORMATTER := 'uniprint'
          WHEN CONV-FORMATTER = 'uniprint' AND #UNMOD = 'NONE'
            CONV-ERC := 2142
            COMPRESS '2142 uniprint' P-NODE-NAME TO CONV-ERT
          WHEN CONV-FORMATTER = 'enscript' AND #ENMOD = 'NONE'
            CONV-ERC := 2142
            COMPRESS '2142 enscript' P-NODE-NAME TO CONV-ERT
          WHEN CONV-FORMATTER = 'uniprint' AND CONV-ERC = 0
            COMPRESS #UNMOD '&+&-out&+&' CONV-PATH '/&F&&+&'
              #UNIPRINT-PARMS '&+&-in' TO #FILES-COMMAND LEAVING NO
          WHEN CONV-FORMATTER = 'enscript' AND CONV-ERC = 0
            COMPRESS #ENMOD '&+&-qZho&+&' CONV-PATH '/&F&&+&'
              #ENSCRIPT-PARMS TO #FILES-COMMAND LEAVING NO
          WHEN NONE
            CONV-ERC := 2142
            COMPRESS '2142 enscript/uniprint' P-NODE-NAME TO CONV-ERT
        END-DECIDE
      END-IF
    END-IF
*
  VALUE 0
    IF CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT NE 'RTF' AND CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT NE 'HTML'
    AND (NOT #TEXTFILES OR CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT NE ' ')                 /*
      COMPRESS '1595' CONV-FORMATTER TO #TRACE-MSG
      DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION
        WHEN CONV-FILENAME NE ' '
          COMPRESS #TRACE-MSG     CONV-FILENAME TO #TRACE-MSG
          COMPRESS #TRACE-MSG '.' CONV-FILETYPE TO #TRACE-MSG LEAVING NO
        WHEN CONV-INFILES NE  ' '
          COMPRESS #TRACE-MSG     CONV-INFILES  TO #TRACE-MSG
        WHEN NONE
          COMPRESS #TRACE-MSG     'output'      TO #TRACE-MSG
      END-DECIDE
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'W' #TRACE-MSG
      END TRANSACTION
      PERFORM PROCESS-FILES
    END-IF
*
  VALUES 0,1589
    IF CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT NE 'RTF' AND CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT NE 'HTML'
*     Concatenate all ps and pdf files to one file of desired format
      IF #TEXTFILES AND CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT =' ' /* only text files found
        RESET CONV-ERC
        COMPRESS 'cat&+&' CONV-PATH '/' CONV-INFILES
          TO #COMMAND LEAVING NO
        #LOGFILE-ID   := #TMPFILE
        P-WAIT-TERM   := 'Z'
        P-OUTPUT-MODE := 'A' /* Append logfile
        PERFORM EXEC-UNIX-COMMAND
      ELSE
        IF #GSMOD = 'NONE'
          CONV-ERC := 2142
          COMPRESS '2142 gs' P-NODE-NAME TO CONV-ERT
        ELSE
          RESET CONV-ERC
          COMPRESS #GSMOD '&+&-q -dBATCH -dNOPAUSE'
            '&+&-sOUTPUTFILE=' #TMPFILE '&+&-sDEVICE=' #DEVICE
            '&+&-c 64000000 setvmthreshold&+&-f'
            '&+&' CONV-PATH '/' CONV-INFILES TO #COMMAND LEAVING NO
          #LOGFILE-ID   := 'default'
          P-WAIT-TERM   := 'N'
          P-OUTPUT-MODE := 'A' /* Append logfile
          PERFORM EXEC-UNIX-COMMAND
        END-IF
      END-IF
    END-IF
  VALUE 0
*
    PERFORM CHECK-LOGFILE
* *****
  VALUES 0,1589
    COMPRESS CONV-PATH '/' CONV-INFILES TO P-FILE-NAME LEAVING NO
    #UX-FUNCTION := 'DELETE'
    PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
    IF CONV-ERT = SCAN('NPR3339')                  /* NOMALL-2088
        OR CONV-ERC = 2036    /* OR CONV-ERC = 12  /* NOMALL-2088
      RESET CONV-ERC CONV-ERT P-ERC P-ERT
    END-IF
* *****
  VALUE 0
    IF CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT = 'PDF' AND #PDFTK NE 'NONE'
    AND CONV-MASK NE ' '                                              /*
      COMPRESS #PDFTK '&+&' #TMPFILE '&+&multistamp&+&'
        CONV-MASK '&+&output&+&' #OUTFILE TO #COMMAND LEAVING NO
      #LOGFILE-ID   := 'default'
      P-WAIT-TERM   := 'N'
      P-OUTPUT-MODE := 'A' /* Append logfile
      PERFORM EXEC-UNIX-COMMAND
    END-IF
* *****
  VALUE 0 /* Delete tempfile afer execution of pdftk
    IF CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT = 'PDF' AND #PDFTK NE 'NONE'
    AND CONV-MASK NE ' '                                              /*
      #UX-FUNCTION := 'DELETE'
      P-FILE-NAME  := #TMPFILE
      PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
    END-IF
* *****
*   Show the resulting file
  VALUE 0
    IF CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT NE 'PDF' OR #PDFTK = 'NONE' OR CONV-MASK = ' '
      #UX-FUNCTION  := 'MOVE'
      P-FILE-NAME   := #TMPFILE
      P-TARGET-FILE := #OUTFILE
      P-WAIT-TERM   := 'N'
      PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
    END-IF
* *****
  VALUES 0,1589 /*  Delete logfiles
    COMPRESS #UTILPATH 'find&+&' CONV-PATH '&+&-name&+&%.*' #TIMESTAMP
      '*.log%&+&-delete' TO #COMMAND LEAVING NO
    EXAMINE #COMMAND FOR '%' REPLACE ''''
    RESET #LOGFILE-ID P-OUTPUT-MODE
    P-WAIT-TERM := 'Z'
    PERFORM EXEC-UNIX-COMMAND
* *****
  VALUE 0 /*  Supply resulting file-id
    RESET #CONV-FILEID
    PERFORM XXCHKFN-CHECK-FILENAME #CONV-FILEID #RC
      1X CONV-FILENAME CONV-FILETYPE
    IF #RC > 1
      CONV-ERC := 1121 /* invalid filename
      CONV-ERT := #CONV-FILEID
      ESCAPE ROUTINE
    END-IF
    +CONV-FILEID := #CONV-FILEID
* *****
  ANY /* Prepare error fields if necessary
    IF CONV-ERT NE ' ' AND CONV-ERT = MASK (NNNN)
      CONV-ERC-A := SUBSTR(CONV-ERT,1,4)
    END-IF
    IF CONV-ERC NE 0
      IF  CONV-ERT NE MASK (NNNN)
        COMPRESS CONV-ERC CONV-ERT TO CONV-ERT
      END-IF
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'W' CONV-ERT
      END TRANSACTION
      IF CONV-ERC = 1589
        RESET CONV-ERC CONV-ERT
      END-IF
     PERFORM XXGETENV-GET-VARS CONV-ERT #GETENV-ERC #GETENV-ERT XXUX---P
    END-IF
*
  NONE
    IGNORE
*
END-DECIDE
*
************************************************************************
* End of main line (now subroutines):
************************************************************************
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE UNIX-FUNCTION
************************************************************************
XXUX---P.P-FUNCTION     := #UX-FUNCTION
XXUX---P.P-LOG-FUNCTION := 'S'
#P-BINARY               := XXUX---P.P-BINARY
XXUX---P.P-BINARY       := 'N'
*
IF CONV-TRACING
  COMPRESS 'Executing Unix function' #UX-FUNCTION '- Node:' P-NODE-NAME
    '- User:' P-USERID '- Group:' P-GROUP '- NodeStatus:' P-NODE-SUSPEND
    '- Binary:' P-BINARY '- Record:' SUBSTR (XXUX---P.P-RECORD,1,30)
    '- File:'   SUBSTR (XXUX---P.P-FILE-NAME,1,70) TO #TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  END TRANSACTION
END-IF
EXAMINE P-FILE-NAME   FOR '//' REPLACE '/'
EXAMINE P-TARGET-FILE FOR '//' REPLACE '/'
IF #UX-FUNCTION = 'MOVE' AND P-TARGET-FILE = ' '
  COMPRESS 'Internal error: Target file is emptyÜ File name was:'
    P-FILE-NAME '*LEVEL =' *LEVEL TO #TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  #TRACE-MSG := 'Now aborting task for error analysis'
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  END TRANSACTION
  MOVE 999 TO *ERROR-NR /* should not occur
END-IF
*
CALLNAT 'XXUX---N' XXUX---P #NPR-TRACE-INT
*
IF CONV-TRACING
  COMPRESS 'Unix function returned:' 'ERC:' XXUX---P.P-ERC
    '- ERT:' XXUX---P.P-ERT '- Record:' SUBSTR (XXUX---P.P-RECORD,1,30)
    TO #TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  END TRANSACTION
END-IF
IF P-ERT = SCAN('output file not found')
  RESET #EXIT-CODE XXUX---P.P-ERC XXUX---P.P-ERT CONV-ERC CONV-ERT
  IF CONV-TRACING
    MOVE 'Error ''output file not found'' has been ignored.'
      TO #TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
    MOVE 'File names with resolved environment variables:'
      TO #TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
    #TRACE-MSG := P-FILE-NAME
    PERFORM XXGETENV-GET-VARS #TRACE-MSG P-ERC P-ERT XXUX---P
    IF P-ERC = 0
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
    END-IF
    #TRACE-MSG := P-RECORD
    PERFORM XXGETENV-GET-VARS #TRACE-MSG P-ERC P-ERT XXUX---P
    IF P-ERC = 0
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
    END-IF
    END TRANSACTION
  END-IF
END-IF
IF P-ERC NE 0 AND #UX-FUNCTION = 'DELETE'
  RESET #EXIT-CODE XXUX---P.P-ERC XXUX---P.P-ERT CONV-ERC CONV-ERT
  IF CONV-TRACING
    MOVE 'Error at file deletion has been ignored.'
      TO #TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
    MOVE 'File names with resolved environment variables:'
      TO #TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
    #TRACE-MSG := P-FILE-NAME
    PERFORM XXGETENV-GET-VARS #TRACE-MSG P-ERC P-ERT XXUX---P
    IF P-ERC = 0
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
    END-IF
    #TRACE-MSG := P-RECORD
    PERFORM XXGETENV-GET-VARS #TRACE-MSG P-ERC P-ERT XXUX---P
    IF P-ERC = 0
      PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
    END-IF
    END TRANSACTION
  END-IF
END-IF
IF #UX-FUNCTION = 'GETEXIT'
  #REP-WAIT := 1
  REPEAT
    UNTIL XXUX---P.P-ERC = 0 OR #REP-WAIT = 3
    CALLNAT 'NAT00031' #SECOND /* Wait a second
    RESET #EXIT-CODE XXUX---P.P-ERC XXUX---P.P-ERT CONV-ERC CONV-ERT
    CALLNAT 'XXUX---N' XXUX---P #NPR-TRACE-INT
    ADD 1 TO #REP-WAIT
  END-REPEAT
  IF P-ERC NE 0
    P-ERC := 2035
    #P-ERT := XXUX---P.P-ERT
    COMPRESS '2035' *PROGRAM 'GETEXIT' P-FILE-NAME TO P-ERT
    COMPRESS P-ERT '/' #P-ERT TO P-ERT LEAVING NO
  END-IF
END-IF
XXUX---P.P-BINARY := #P-BINARY
CONV-ERC          := XXUX---P.P-ERC
CONV-ERT          := XXUX---P.P-ERT
IF #UX-FUNCTION = 'INFO'
  #P-OPSYS := XXUX---P.P-OPSYS
  EXAMINE #P-OPSYS AND TRANSLATE INTO UPPER
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* UNIX-FUNCTION
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE PROCESS-FILES
************************************************************************
REPEAT
  REDUCE DYNAMIC #MR-P-BUFFER     TO 0
  REDUCE DYNAMIC #FILES-REMAINING TO 0
  P-FILE-NAME := #FILES
  P-ERC := #P-ERC
  #UX-FUNCTION := 'DIR'
  PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
  DECIDE FOR EVERY CONDITION
    WHEN P-ERT = SCAN ('NPR3339')                  /* NOMALL-2088
        OR P-ERC = 2036                            /* NOMALL-2088
      COMPRESS 'No files found:' P-FILE-NAME TO #TRACE-MSG
      IF CONV-TRACING
        PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
        END TRANSACTION
      END-IF
      RESET CONV-ERC CONV-ERT P-ERC P-ERT
    WHEN P-ERC = 0  OR = 19 OR = 13
        OR P-ERT = SCAN ('3345') /* same as P-erc=19
      IF P-ERT = SCAN ('3345')
        #P-ERC := 19
      ELSE
        RESET #P-ERC
      END-IF
      #FILES-REMAINING := #MR-P-BUFFER
      EXAMINE #FILES-REMAINING FOR #ZEROBYTE GIVING POSITION IN #POS
      DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION
        WHEN #POS = 1
          RESET #FILES-REMAINING
        WHEN #POS > 1
          #POS := #POS - 1
          MOVE SUBSTR(#FILES-REMAINING,1,#POS) TO #FILES-REMAINING
        WHEN NONE
          IGNORE
      END-DECIDE
      REPEAT UNTIL #FILES-REMAINING = ' '
        RESET CONV-ERC CONV-ERT
        SEPARATE #FILES-REMAINING INTO #FILE
          REMAINDER #FILES-REMAINING WITH DELIMITER ';'
        EXAMINE #FILE FOR ' ' GIVING LENGTH IN #LEN
        EXAMINE FULL #FILE FOR ' ' GIVING POSITION IN #POS
        IF #POS < #LEN
          CONV-ERC := 1121   /* file contains blanks
          CONV-ERT := #FILE
          ESCAPE MODULE
        END-IF     /* xsetggr 2010-02-24 P312421 end
        PERFORM CHECK-TYPE
        RESET CONV-ERC CONV-ERT
        IF #FILES-COMMAND NE ' ' /* if empty, do chec only
          #COMMAND := #FILES-COMMAND
          RESET       #FILE2TYPE
          COMPRESS #COMMAND '&+&' CONV-PATH '/' #FILE
            TO #COMMAND LEAVING NO
          EXAMINE DIRECTION BACKWARD #FILE FOR '.' GIVING POSITION #POS
          IF #POS > 1
            #POS  := #POS - 1
            #FILE2 := SUBSTR(#FILE,1,#POS)
            #POS  := #POS + 2
            IF #POS LE #LEN
              #FILE2TYPE := SUBSTR(#FILE,#POS)
            ELSE
              RESET #FILE2TYPE
            END-IF
          ELSE
            #FILE2 := #FILE
            RESET #FILE2TYPE
          END-IF
          COMPRESS #FILE2 '.ps' TO #FILE2 LEAVING NO
          IF #FILE NE #FILE2 /* avoid to copy to itself
          AND #FILE2TYPE NE 'pdf'                                     /*
            EXAMINE #COMMAND FOR '&+&' REPLACE ' '
            EXAMINE #COMMAND FOR '&F&' REPLACE WITH #FILE2
            #LOGFILE-ID   := 'default'
            P-WAIT-TERM   := 'N'
            P-OUTPUT-MODE := 'A' /* Append logfile
            PERFORM EXEC-UNIX-COMMAND
            PERFORM CHECK-LOGFILE
            IF CONV-ERC NE 0
              ESCAPE MODULE
            END-IF
            COMPRESS CONV-PATH '/' #FILE TO P-FILE-NAME LEAVING NO
            #UX-FUNCTION := 'DELETE'
            PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
            IF CONV-ERT = SCAN('NPR3339')               /* NOMALL-2088
            OR CONV-ERC = 2036          /* OR CONV-ERC = 12  NOMALL-2088
              RESET CONV-ERC CONV-ERT P-ERC P-ERT
            END-IF
          END-IF
        END-IF
      END-REPEAT
*
    WHEN NONE
      IF P-ERT NE ' '
        CONV-ERC:= 5
        COMPRESS *PROGRAM P-ERT TO CONV-ERT
      ELSE
        COMPRESS *PROGRAM 'Error' P-ERC 'occurred' TO CONV-ERT
      END-IF
      ESCAPE MODULE
  END-DECIDE
  UNTIL #P-ERC NE 19 /* 19 = more files to be read with DIR function
END-REPEAT
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* PROCESS-FILES
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE CHECK-TYPE
************************************************************************
IF CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT NE 'RTF' AND CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT NE 'HTML'
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
COMPRESS CONV-PATH '/' #FILE TO P-FILE-NAME LEAVING NO
*
#UX-FUNCTION := 'GETATTR'
PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
IF P-ERC NE 0
  CONV-ERC := P-ERC
  CONV-ERT := P-ERT
  ESCAPE MODULE
END-IF
IF P-MIME-TYPE NE ' ' AND P-MIME-TYPE NE SCAN ('PLAIN')
  CONV-ERC := 2143
  COMPRESS '2143' #FILE CONV-OUTPUT-FORMAT TO CONV-ERT
  ESCAPE MODULE
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* CHECK-TYPE
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE EXEC-UNIX-COMMAND
************************************************************************
EXAMINE #COMMAND FOR '&+&' REPLACE ' '
MOVE LEFT #COMMAND TO #COMMAND
EXAMINE #COMMAND  '//' REPLACE '/'
XXUX---P.P-RECORD         := SUBSTR(#COMMAND,1,250)
XXUX---P.P-COMMAND-PART-2-3 := SUBSTR(#COMMAND,251)
SEPARATE #COMMAND INTO #COMMAND IGNORE WITH DELIMITER ' '
IF #LOGFILE-ID = 'default'
  COMPRESS CONV-LOGPATH '/.' CONV-FILENAME '-' #TIMESTAMP
    '-' *PID '.log' TO #LOGFILE-ID LEAVING NO
  PERFORM XXCHKFN-CHECK-FILENAME #LOGFILE-ID #RC
END-IF
XXUX---P.P-FILE-NAME := #LOGFILE-ID
#UX-FUNCTION := 'COMMAND'
IF CONV-TRACING
  #TRACE-MSG := '===================='
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  COMPRESS 'Executing Unix command:' XXUX---P.P-RECORD TO #TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  COMPRESS 'With log file:' XXUX---P.P-FILE-NAME TO #TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  #TRACE-MSG := '===================='
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  END TRANSACTION
END-IF
PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
IF CONV-TRACING
  COMPRESS 'Got PID:' XXUX---P.P-PROCESS-ID TO #TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  END TRANSACTION
END-IF
#P-PROCESS-ID := XXUX---P.P-PROCESS-ID
RESET P-OUTPUT-MODE P-WAIT-TERM
IF P-ERT = SCAN ('NPR3355')
  RESET P-ERC P-ERT
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* EXEC-UNIX-COMMAND
*
************************************************************************
DEFINE SUBROUTINE CHECK-LOGFILE
************************************************************************
RESET #REP #WARNING #EXIT-CODE
RESET #REP-WAIT
IF #LOGFILE-ID NE SCAN('.log')
  RESET CONV-ERC CONV-ERT
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
#STACK-FUNCTION := 'PUSH' /* stack parameter for XXUX---N
CALLNAT 'XXUXST-N' #STACK-FUNCTION #STACK-RC XXUX---P
IF #STACK-RC NE 0
  CONV-ERC := 5
  COMPRESS *PROGRAM 'Internal error: Stack overflow' *LINE TO CONV-ERT
  ESCAPE MODULE
END-IF
#REP-WAIT := 1
IF CONV-TRACING
  #TRACE-MSG := '===================='
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  COMPRESS 'Checking logfile:' #LOGFILE-ID TO #TRACE-MSG
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  #TRACE-MSG := '===================='
  PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
  END TRANSACTION
END-IF
WAITLOG. REPEAT
  UNTIL #REP-WAIT > 1800 OR CONV-ERC NE 0 /* max wait half an hour
  IF #REP-WAIT > 1
    CALLNAT 'NAT00031' #SECOND /* Wait a second
  END-IF
  IF #P-PROCESS-ID NE 0 /* will be set by NPR Unix 2.1.4.19 and above
    #UX-FUNCTION          := 'STATUS'
    XXUX---P.P-PROCESS-ID := #P-PROCESS-ID
    PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
    IF XXUX---P.P-STATUS = 2 THRU 5 /* running or sleeping
      #REP-WAIT := #REP-WAIT + 1
      ESCAPE TOP
    END-IF
  END-IF
  RESET P-FILE-NAME P-FILE-HANDLE P-RECORD #EOF
  P-FUNCTION := 'CLOSE'
  P-FILE-NAME := #LOGFILE-ID
  EXAMINE P-FILE-NAME   FOR '//' REPLACE '/'
  CALLNAT 'XXUX---N' XXUX---P #NPR-TRACE-INT
  P-FILE-NAME := #LOGFILE-ID
  IF CONV-TRACING
    #NPR-TRACE-INT := *LEVEL + 1
    CALLNAT 'XXLOCKED' XXUX---P #NPR-TRACE-INT #FILE-LOCKED
    END TRANSACTION
  ELSE
    RESET #NPR-TRACE-INT
    CALLNAT 'XXLOCKED' XXUX---P 1X #FILE-LOCKED
  END-IF
  DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION
    WHEN #FILE-LOCKED = 'N'
      ESCAPE BOTTOM (WAITLOG.)
    WHEN #FILE-LOCKED = 'Y'
      IGNORE
    WHEN ANY
      #REP-WAIT := #REP-WAIT + 1
      ESCAPE TOP
    WHEN NONE
      IGNORE
  END-DECIDE
  ESCAPE BOTTOM (WAITLOG.)
END-REPEAT
P-FUNCTION := 'OPEN'
P-FILE-NAME := #LOGFILE-ID
EXAMINE P-FILE-NAME   FOR '//' REPLACE '/'
CALLNAT 'XXUX---N' XXUX---P #NPR-TRACE-INT
READLOG. REPEAT
  P-FUNCTION := 'READ'
  CALLNAT 'XXUX---N' XXUX---P #NPR-TRACE-INT
  #RECORD := XXUX---P.P-RECORD
  EXAMINE #RECORD AND TRANSLATE INTO LOWER
  IF CONV-TRACING
    COMPRESS 'Log record read:' #RECORD TO #TRACE-MSG
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'T' #TRACE-MSG
    END TRANSACTION
  END-IF
  DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION
    WHEN #RECORD = SCAN('which: no ') /* thrown by 'which'
    OR = SCAN('could not find')       /* thrown by 'where'            /*
    OR (#RECORD = SCAN('which:') AND #RECORD = SCAN(' no ')) /* AIX   /*
      #EXIT-CODE := 127
      P-FILE-NAME := #LOGFILE-ID
      #UX-FUNCTION             := 'DELETE'
      PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
    WHEN #RECORD=SCAN('npr3355 exit code 0') AND CONV-ERC=0 /*lowercase
      P-FILE-NAME := #LOGFILE-ID
      #UX-FUNCTION             := 'DELETE'
      PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
    WHEN #RECORD = SCAN('+ exit') /* from routine CHECK-MODULE
      SEPARATE #RECORD INTO CONV-ERT CONV-ERT CONV-ERT IGNORE
        WITH DELIMITER ' '
      IF CONV-ERT IS (N3)
        CONV-ERC := VAL (CONV-ERT)
      END-IF
      IF CONV-ERC NE 0
        #EXIT-CODE := 127
      END-IF
      P-FILE-NAME := #LOGFILE-ID
      #UX-FUNCTION             := 'DELETE'
      PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
    WHEN #RECORD = SCAN('unrecoverable error') OR = SCAN('couldn''t')
      CONV-ERC := 1588
      COMPRESS  CONV-ERC #LOGFILE-ID TO #FILP
      PERFORM XXGETENV-GET-VARS #FILP P-ERC P-ERT XXUX---P
      CONV-ERT := #FILP
    WHEN (#RECORD = SCAN('error') OR = SCAN('warning'))
        AND #RECORD NE SCAN('unrecoverable')
      #WARNING := TRUE
      ESCAPE TOP
    WHEN #EOF OR #REP > 200 /* end of file or 200 lines read
      ESCAPE BOTTOM (READLOG.)
    WHEN P-ERC NE 0
      IF P-ERT = SCAN('NPR3339')               /* NOMALL-2088
          OR P-ERC = 2036                      /* NOMALL-2088
        RESET CONV-ERC CONV-ERT
      ELSE
        CONV-ERC := 2144
        COMPRESS P-FUNCTION P-ERT #LOGFILE-ID TO CONV-ERT
      END-IF
    WHEN ANY
      #CONV-ERC    := CONV-ERC
      #CONV-ERT    := CONV-ERT
      #UX-FUNCTION := 'CLOSE'
      P-FILE-NAME  := #LOGFILE-ID
      PERFORM UNIX-FUNCTION
      RESET P-ERC P-ERT /* Ignore if already closed.
      CONV-ERC     := #CONV-ERC
      CONV-ERT     := #CONV-ERT
      ESCAPE BOTTOM (READLOG.)
    WHEN NONE
      IGNORE
  END-DECIDE
  ADD 1 TO #REP
END-REPEAT
DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION
  WHEN #WARNING AND CONV-ERC = 0
    CONV-ERC := 1589
    COMPRESS  CONV-ERC #LOGFILE-ID TO #FILP
    PERFORM XXGETENV-GET-VARS #FILP P-ERC P-ERT XXUX---P
    CONV-ERT := #FILP
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'W' CONV-ERT
    END TRANSACTION
  WHEN NONE
    IGNORE
END-DECIDE
RESET P-WAIT-TERM
#STACK-FUNCTION := 'POP' /* stack parameter for XXUX---N
CALLNAT 'XXUXST-N' #STACK-FUNCTION #STACK-RC XXUX---P
IF #STACK-RC NE 0
  CONV-ERC := 5
  COMPRESS *PROGRAM 'Internal error: Stack overflow' *LINE TO CONV-ERT
  ESCAPE MODULE
END-IF
*
END-SUBROUTINE /* CHECK-LOGFILE
*
************************************************************************
ON ERROR
************************************************************************
  BACKOUT TRANSACTION
  IF *ERROR-NR = 1308        /* too many parameters in #COMMAND
    CONV-ERC := 1590
    SEPARATE #COMMAND INTO #COMMAND IGNORE
    COMPRESS CONV-ERC #COMMAND *ERROR-LINE TO CONV-ERT
    PERFORM XXRLOG-WRITE-LOG 'W' CONV-ERT
    END TRANSACTION
    ESCAPE ROUTINE
  END-IF
  CONV-ERC := 21
  CALLNAT 'C-NATERN' CONV-ERT 'W'
END-ERROR
*
END
